[{"id":"cnm_h151_q1","topicId":"cnm_h151","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"点 P(3，−1，5) 的竖坐标是多少？","answer":"5","explanation":"有序三元数的第三个分量是竖坐标，等于 5。","verify":"5"},{"id":"cnm_h151_q2","topicId":"cnm_h151","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"点 (0，0，4) 在哪一条坐标轴上？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"x 轴"},{"key":"B","text":"z 轴"},{"key":"C","text":"y 轴"},{"key":"D","text":"不在任何坐标轴上"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"x=0 且 y=0，点在 z 轴上，竖坐标是 4。","verify":"\"z 轴\""},{"id":"cnm_h151_q3","topicId":"cnm_h151","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"空间直角坐标系的三条轴之间的位置关系是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"两两平行"},{"key":"B","text":"一定共面且重合"},{"key":"C","text":"两两垂直"},{"key":"D","text":"相交但不垂直"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"右手系里 x 轴、y 轴、z 轴交于原点并且两两垂直。","verify":"\"两两垂直\""},{"id":"cnm_h151_q4","topicId":"cnm_h151","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"点 A(2，0，0) 到原点的距离是多少？","answer":"2","explanation":"点在 x 轴上，到原点的距离就是横坐标的绝对值 2。","verify":"2"},{"id":"cnm_h152_q1","topicId":"cnm_h152","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"A(1，2，0)，B(4，2，5)。向量 AB 的横坐标是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"终点横坐标减起点横坐标：4−1=3。","verify":"4-1"},{"id":"cnm_h152_q2","topicId":"cnm_h152","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"A(0，1，2)，B(0，1，6)。向量 AB 的竖坐标是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"竖坐标之差是 6−2=4，另外两个分量都是 0。","verify":"6-2"},{"id":"cnm_h152_q3","topicId":"cnm_h152","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"向量 a=(3，−2，1) 的纵坐标是多少？","answer":"-2","explanation":"第二个分量就是纵坐标 −2。","verify":"-2"},{"id":"cnm_h152_q4","topicId":"cnm_h152","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"相等的空间向量，它们的坐标必须怎样？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"三个分量分别相等"},{"key":"B","text":"只要模相等"},{"key":"C","text":"只要横坐标相等"},{"key":"D","text":"坐标可以差一个常数"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"向量相等当且仅当对应分量都相等。","verify":"\"三个分量分别相等\""},{"id":"cnm_h153_q1","topicId":"cnm_h153","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，0，2)，b=(3，4，−1)。2a+b 的横坐标是多少？","answer":"5","explanation":"2a=(2，0，4)，再加 b，横坐标是 2+3=5。","verify":"2*1+3"},{"id":"cnm_h153_q2","topicId":"cnm_h153","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(1，2，2)，b=(2，−1，3)。a·b 等于多少？","answer":"6","explanation":"2−2+6=6。","verify":"1*2+2*(-1)+2*3"},{"id":"cnm_h153_q3","topicId":"cnm_h153","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"a=(2，−1，2)。|a|² 等于多少？","answer":"9","explanation":"模的平方就是坐标平方和：4+1+4=9。","verify":"2*2+(-1)*(-1)+2*2"},{"id":"cnm_h153_q4","topicId":"cnm_h153","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"坐标运算里，两个向量相加时应该怎么做？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"分量全部相乘"},{"key":"B","text":"对应分量分别相加"},{"key":"C","text":"只把模相加"},{"key":"D","text":"把三个分量加到第一个分量上"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"加法、减法和数乘都是按分量进行的。","verify":"\"对应分量分别相加\""},{"id":"cnm_h154_q1","topicId":"cnm_h154","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"A(0，0，0)，B(2，3，6)。AB 的长度是多少？","answer":"7","explanation":"√(4+9+36)=√49=7。","verify":"isqrt(4+9+36)"},{"id":"cnm_h154_q2","topicId":"cnm_h154","difficulty":"basic","type":"numeric","prompt":"A(1，2，2)，B(1，6，2)。AB 的长度是多少？","answer":"4","explanation":"只有纵坐标差 4，距离是 4。","verify":"isqrt(0+16+0)"},{"id":"cnm_h154_q3","topicId":"cnm_h154","difficulty":"standard","type":"numeric","prompt":"A(1，1，1)，B(2，2，2)。AB 的长度的平方是多少？","answer":"3","explanation":"三个坐标差都是 1，距离的平方是 3。","verify":"1+1+1"},{"id":"cnm_h154_q4","topicId":"cnm_h154","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"空间两点距离公式，本质上用的是哪一条定理？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"三角形内角和"},{"key":"B","text":"平行线分线段成比例"},{"key":"C","text":"勾股定理"},{"key":"D","text":"圆周角定理"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"三个互相垂直的坐标差构成直角关系，距离由勾股定理得到。","verify":"\"勾股定理\""}]
